WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:13.847 --> 00:00:18.476
Irellars Granbahamal tona galtoeba rilex.

00:00:20.562 --> 00:00:22.564
He had gone insane.

00:00:25.442 --> 00:00:28.194
Yes, well…

00:00:29.362 --> 00:00:30.488
Japanese?

00:00:33.116 --> 00:00:34.200
Sorry about that.

00:00:34.284 --> 00:00:39.205
I just came back from spending
17 years in Granbahamal.

00:00:43.668 --> 00:00:45.128
Let's check your temperature.

00:00:45.211 --> 00:00:48.506
Zalbe madira kolstonam kolstonam.

00:00:49.716 --> 00:00:50.884
Isn't that right?

00:00:54.721 --> 00:00:57.515
Del storba tona rabelt gal.

00:00:57.599 --> 00:01:00.268
All right, see you during the next round.

00:01:08.485 --> 00:01:10.904
You must be Takafumi, my sister's kid.

00:01:11.863 --> 00:01:13.490
You've grown up.

00:01:14.407 --> 00:01:15.825
Where is everyone?

00:01:18.244 --> 00:01:19.704
After you fell into a coma,

00:01:19.829 --> 00:01:25.668
the family fought bitterly over
what to do with you until it fell apart.

00:01:27.253 --> 00:01:29.839
Honestly speaking,
my mom would rather not see you.

00:01:29.923 --> 00:01:31.841
MY FAMILY FELL APART
DUE TO FIGHTING OVER ME

00:01:35.136 --> 00:01:36.513
Icuras cuora.

00:01:40.141 --> 00:01:41.142
Well then,

00:01:41.851 --> 00:01:44.312
let me prove to you that
I lived in another world.

00:01:44.437 --> 00:01:46.689
What? No, thanks.

00:01:47.524 --> 00:01:49.484
War-grent seld.

00:01:50.485 --> 00:01:52.362
SPRING WATER

00:01:52.946 --> 00:01:53.947
What?

00:01:54.447 --> 00:01:55.865
War-grent magna!

00:01:59.410 --> 00:02:01.162
War-grent rald!

00:02:01.204 --> 00:02:02.956
-This is hard to watch…
-War-grent neld!

00:02:03.540 --> 00:02:05.041
War-grent gad!

00:02:05.166 --> 00:02:06.167
War-grent pad!

00:02:06.209 --> 00:02:08.044
-You know…
-War-grent larch!

00:02:08.169 --> 00:02:10.505
…the economic decline
has been hard on me, too.

00:02:11.172 --> 00:02:13.341
I work part-time to support myself.

00:02:14.008 --> 00:02:17.178
I brought papers for you to apply
for self-reliance support and whatnot.

00:02:17.262 --> 00:02:18.513
Wind, lift!

00:02:28.189 --> 00:02:29.232
No way!

00:02:29.816 --> 00:02:31.192
Wind, return.

00:02:33.278 --> 00:02:35.572
Japanese works in this world.

